Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,November 11th?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a special day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know. 11-11. Make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure I'm gonna be busy around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy that day, and it's\Nsomething that I can't get out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, big sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to Yaniko Neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.22,0:01:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we've rehearsed enough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe she was\Nactually worried about her birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.48,0:01:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Yani Neko has a soft side too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, what is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I made this stuffed Yani\Nas a present for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I used some of her real hair, which\Nmade it look like she has a twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.64,0:01:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywho, I wonder why\NYaniko isn't here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me nobody thought\Nto invite her to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now wouldn't that just be a hoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.28,0:01:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, just keep watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be so epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is Kaoruko here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.44,0:03:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoruko, her first name, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you freaking out so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.90,0:03:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know Kaoruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.28,0:03:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She has a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even held\Nhands with a guy before!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She is such a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:03:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:03:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought her panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's even doing it with this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Doggy style. Shower sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.32,0:04:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With cuddling after.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They had a curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch my panty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a traitor! What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the mix-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.06,0:04:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This jackass here is my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, the name's Shunran.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.08,0:04:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.99,0:04:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how\Nmuch I hate you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.38,0:04:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn it! You know what? Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're siblings then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured it was that,\Nto be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, there's no way that you would\Nhave a boyfriend, right, Kansai?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:04:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't gonna let you trick me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the truth is,\Nwe're only half-siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's incest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Forbidden love? Quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.54,0:05:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you, he's lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nishi, you want another drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you can have some of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It tastes better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.23,0:05:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you guys leave her alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone's gonna get her\Nanother drink, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.60,0:05:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Y 'all are sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.51,0:05:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna step away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go find the powder room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.36,0:05:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.27,0:05:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us, Nishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.19,0:05:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you so much, Nishi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times are you\Ngonna say that to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.90,0:05:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just pretend I didn't hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna smell like smoke. Huh? Nishi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I thought you went to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, well, I just\Nwanted to sober up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah, so did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.92,0:06:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Chilly out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nishi, I wanted to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really mature and\Nyou're considerate as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're also graceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.82,0:06:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm none of those things, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's crazy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I could never be\Nthe organizer for a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not really good at talking\Nto people like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.28,0:06:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the only reason I'm the organizer\Nis because I finished my thesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not that good\Nat socializing either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a pervert alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Never a dull moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to head back inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A pervert has burned to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:06:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody catch her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanni's the downtown pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you cooking inside a volcano or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.60,0:07:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When you make a bonfire,\Nyou gotta be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.94,0:07:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hard fireman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.02,0:07:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be burned to a crisp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.48,0:07:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hang on, Nishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you normally act like?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say it's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name isn't Nishi, it's Kansai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your damn map!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.86,0:07:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I love this sight of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that up until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you were so perfect it\Nwas hard to approach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that I've seen this, I really,\NI really want you to be my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.88,0:07:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kansai, give me a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.72,0:07:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you just go away? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You smoke even though you're\Nstill a college student?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, no, I wouldn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But I smoke too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:08:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just promise me you won't tell\Nanyone else about this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite a choice\Nof brand you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.46,0:08:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I guess that's that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.02,0:08:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So then we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you keep up the\Nact? It's definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,not easy give me a\Ncigarette chain smoker cat
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The first wind of spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.12,0:08:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That was three full days\Nworth of work! SHUT!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind just blow away\Nmy entire manuscript!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your manuscript?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say, you really\Nsaved me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't shown up right then, I\Nfor sure wouldn't have made my deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.78,0:09:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.69,0:09:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad it happened, because now I get\Nto visit a professional's workplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Time really does fly, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a year ago, and we\Nblink and it's almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.06,0:09:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a pretty eventful year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.26,0:09:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you're a published author,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you were still kind enough to give\Nadvice to an amateur writer like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.38,0:09:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look up to her way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, of course I look up to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuro makes a living doing\Nsomething that she loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an inspiration to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that why you're working\Nas her assistant now, Yani?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never actually read Tatsuro's manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd read it at least once so\Nyou'd remember the character's hair color.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.28,0:10:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, your own assistant hasn't\Neven read your books before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just not acceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As a creator, that lack of awareness is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you even read Mankasu's manga before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.64,0:10:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I bought all of them, but I'm\Njust saving them to read another time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, I'm sure you've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she seriously still believe in Santa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not the type to do\Nsomething all cute like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just a prank?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:10:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you want to bet she asked\Nfor cigarettes or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, she's the one who wanted to\Nhave this Christmas drinking party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Santa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A nice smoking area for\NChristmas would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.80,0:11:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You smoke with or without a smoking area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, that's not something\Nyou can put in a stocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.88,0:11:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she wrote more on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and smoking with my friends\Nin the sun would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That made me kind of emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew she had feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at us doing the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to say I'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't played in\Nsnow since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sake and snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:11:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.58,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is super cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be angry if we\Ndid this again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the cold making these drinks stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't blame the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just the booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.94,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let a girl live a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drink to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking out the trash is a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the smoking area made of snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.90,0:13:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow sculptures?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they're so elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to rescue us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If I keep drinking at this pace,\NI'll be trashed before New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.86,0:13:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pass out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We still have to go to the shrine tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who falls asleep loses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.26,0:13:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't really taste like sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.47,0:13:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,if anyone falls asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,then they have to shove their\Nunderwear in the landlord's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.58,0:13:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have to stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.16,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.20,0:13:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you would love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We seriously can't fall asleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom's kind of sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.72,0:14:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the annual New Year's\NMochi Pounding begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yani Nickel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pound it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You pour water on the\Nmochi and knead it! Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.06,0:14:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand the landlord\Nbeing all excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.96,0:14:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but what's with Yani being so fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she got cigarettes as payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.88,0:14:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too early in the\Nmorning to be doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Mochi Pound!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And hurry! Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.60,0:14:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Been a while since I've shown\Noff my high-speed mochi pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.96,0:14:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm a little rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.68,0:14:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.59,0:14:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Yani Neko go? Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.22,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.02,0:15:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have expected\Nthat from her. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it cools down, we'll shape it. Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this. There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I getting red bean\Npaste in these ones? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are going to be the mugwort mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that mugwort is said to\Nward off evil spirits and misfortune?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as some call it, yaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you guys think this mochi kind\Nof looks like Yanni's hair color?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It might start smelling like cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's fire this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yanni's Echo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.56,0:15:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.34,0:15:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That was my first dream of the year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:15:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It had bad omen written all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to keep sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you wake up already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, it's time to pound some mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.54,0:16:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, Happy New Year!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.28,0:16:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for our building's\Nannual New Year's Mochi Pounding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.90,0:16:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yani Neko! Nyup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pound it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your job is to pour water on the\Nmochi and knead it! Got it? Nyup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand the landlord\Nbeing all excited,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but what's with Yani being so fired up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's paying her in\Na bunch of cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too early in the\Nmorning to be doing this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get it done, Yani Nicole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.98,0:16:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.94,0:16:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:16:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,With gusto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.12,0:17:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They said it was cigarette poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor thing was still so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.86,0:17:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,See that bald guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, a cigarette got mixed\Ninto the mochi he was making.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to pound some mochi. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I in a time loop?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to pound some mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.18,0:17:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pound the mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.00,0:17:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why it's happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,but I keep repeating the day\Nof the mochi pounding, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:17:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Amigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone dies every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.44,0:18:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Each day starts off the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's bounce the mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to escape\Nfrom this time loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.22,0:18:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if I can just finish\Nthis mochi pounding peacefully
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,without anyone dying, then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.60,0:18:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The weather is awesome for New Year's Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.70,0:18:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect for making mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The landlord seems a\Nlittle bit sad though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, when do we get to dig this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Up until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever they got close to the\Nmortar, a fatal accident would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to do something crazy\Nenough to keep them all away from it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go and fall down,\Ncouple with the mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That being stomped around like\Na fatal death shot of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.48,0:18:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They should keep everyone away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the cannon sticks are kicking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yani, don't touch it, it's giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yani, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's all strides and no balls! It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was both soft and\Nhard at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.90,0:19:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The loop didn't start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Has it ended?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one that knows\Nabout this loop of fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Otani, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We just received a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come with us to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Chainsmoker cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:19:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd go get some\NAwachi Island burgers today!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just relax a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Relaxing was before eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And unless you plan on freezing\Nto death, we need more kerosene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit lollygagging!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.66,0:20:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go and get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.90,0:20:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, that's such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.70,0:20:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off, you dung beetle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.76,0:20:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, for crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.78,0:20:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Traffic on a holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll tear all\Nthese people a new one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.82,0:20:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See how much Mom loves traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.46,0:20:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure is loud with her love. You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,ever since you started living in that\Napartment, you've been acting more like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that back or a whoop your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your damn mouths!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.74,0:20:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we haven't moved\Nan inch and I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.62,0:20:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, here's your\Nhomemade Awaji Eileen burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing better than being at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize you're the\None who wanted to go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoruko, did you put on a\Nfew pounds over the holidays?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my old maternity clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.14,0:21:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want them, Shunran? Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you do kind of have\Na big butt, though, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wear those clothes backwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The part that's for the belly\Nwill fit over your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.24,0:21:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more burgers if\Nyou want. No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a cow, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.28,0:21:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,After we eat, it's family time!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.24,0:21:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we all play a board game\Ntogether and watch Shinky Geki?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.84,0:21:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't been back home in a good\Nwhile, so mom's all needy, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.90,0:21:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I have an idea. You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been working on my beatboxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a rat sauce about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if you lose, that means\Nyou gotta stay longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.72,0:21:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray, let's get this going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've dumped them shit, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.18,0:22:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of this goddamn house.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Boom, boom, hello, I'm Soonron.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no longer just doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.60,0:22:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your heart is being. Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.42,0:22:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart's feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.68,0:22:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart is associated with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.54,0:22:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.16,0:23:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do we use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.16,0:23:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They are. I'm down on the work. I'm\Nback through. I'm down on the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.22,0:23:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Or by the way At the corner of the people\NI'm down on the road For sure, I just know
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.40,0:24:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
